Project name- Webqinz

Description- Webqinz is a web application for a virtual pet's world.
              The application allows users to create and manage their own pet's virtual world.
              Users can perform actions such as feeding the pet, let them play,
              put them to sleep, and earning free points with a guessing numbers.

Main features- Create a new pet
               Connect to an existing pet
               Feed the pet with different food options
               Play lots of games with the pet
               Let the pet sleep to restore energy
               Guess numbers to earn free points
               View pet current status (hunger, energy, happiness, points and general rate)
               View the pet metrics monitoring

Project Structure- my_first_dragon/     the base directory of the project
                    *const/             the const that being in use all over the project
                    *log_files/         the log files of each pet
                    *models/            the model of the pet object
                    *monitoring_data/   the samples files of each pet for the monitoring
                    *pets_db/           the db that store the pets objects
                    *services/          the logic and data handling
                    *web/               Flask routes and web interface
                        *static/            CSS
                        *templates/         HTML pages

Technologiyaaaa- Python
                 Flask
                 HTML
                 CSS
                 JSON

How to run the project- 1. clone the repo
                        2. go to the project folder 
                        3. run the app by "python -m web.app"
                        4. go to the browser and search "http://{your ip or the lo address 127.0.0.1}:8080/"
                        5. create/connect to your own pet
                        6. start play 


